{"availability":"available","full":"kspo/super_cupertino_navigation_bar","name":"super_cupertino_navigation_bar","description":"This package offers a collapsible app bar along with an attractive search bar animation, enhancing the visual appeal of your Flutter app with an iOS-inspired design. This package is versatile, allowing complete customization, and it seamlessly works on both iOS and Android platforms.","category":"Design","language":"Dart","stars":86,"forks":22,"created":"2023-10-16T10:58:24Z","updated":"2024-09-01T23:00:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pub.dev/packages/super_cupertino_navigation_bar","topics":["appbar","cupertino","dart","flutter","navigation","package"],"demo":"https://kspo.github.io/super_cupertino_navigation_bar/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:27.000Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:27.000Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:27.000Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T13:19:27.000Z","stars":86,"forks":22}],"technologies":["Flutter"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["As a developer passionate about Apple UI/UX designs, I felt that Flutter lacked sufficient support for a widget that I wanted to develop. CupertinoSliverNavigationBar does not provide support for a search bar and a bottom app bar. Additionally, even if you were to add them as Slivers, creating a built-in animation and, furthermore, implementing Apple transition animations during page transitions would be challenging. This plugin frees you from this burden.","Using SuperScaffold provides several advantages and additional features compared to the standard Scaffold in Flutter. Here are some reasons why you might consider using SuperScaffold:"],"features":["Configurability: SuperScaffold allows you to easily configure and customize various parts of the app bar, including the title, large title, search bar, and bottom bar. This provides flexibility in adapting the app bar…","Search Bar Integration: With SuperScaffold, you can integrate a search bar (SuperSearchBar) directly into the app bar, complete with customizable behavior, animation, and callbacks for handling user input.","Large Title Support: The SuperLargeTitle feature enables the use of large titles in the app bar, which can be particularly useful in applications with a prominent navigation hierarchy.","Bottom Bar Options: The SuperAppBarBottom feature allows you to add a bottom bar below the app bar, providing additional space for interactive elements or navigation controls.","Consistent Theming: SuperScaffold includes theming options to ensure a consistent look and feel throughout your application. You can customize colors, borders, and other visual aspects easily."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kspo/super_cupertino_navigation_bar/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"90270775b8f6c3f43bff08c10d9ef292e1e0fb46e139b0c29c4b31039106acb9","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:27.117Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:27.117Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"As a developer passionate about Apple UI/UX designs, I felt that Flutter lacked sufficient support for a widget that I wanted to develop. CupertinoSliverNavigationBar does not provide support for a search bar and a bottom app bar. Additionally, even if you were to add them as Slivers, creating a built-in animation and, furthermore, implementing Apple transition animations during page transitions would be challenging. This plugin frees you from this burden.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kspo/super_cupertino_navigation_bar/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"90270775b8f6c3f43bff08c10d9ef292e1e0fb46e139b0c29c4b31039106acb9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kspo/super_cupertino_navigation_bar/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:27.118Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-09-01T23:00:27Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kspo/super_cupertino_naviga